<title>USA: Kensey Nash Corp Q3 March 31 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Kensey Nash Corp Q3 March 31 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>EXTON, Pa. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q3		    Nine Months</p>
<p>			  1997	  1996	  1997	  1996</p>
<p>Total revenues</p>
<p>		    2,027,082     438,715   6,067,573   2,169,784</p>
<p>Deferred compensation,</p>
<p>officers and directors</p>
<p>			     --	    --	    --   1,493,576</p>
<p> Insurance settlement  --	    --     968,761	    --</p>
<p>Net (loss) income</p>
<p>		    (374,444) (1,507,746)     343,498 (5,849,622)</p>
<p>(Loss) income per</p>
<p>  common share     (0.05)	(0.21)	  0.05	(1.06)</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>shares outstanding</p>
<p>		    7,197,899   7,156,493   7,326,331   5,520,605</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said results for the third quarter in fiscal 1996 were adversely affected by major damage to its manufacturing facility and the subsequent interruption of production.</p>
<p>1997 nine month period includes $969,000, or $0.13 per share, of income recognized in connection with settlement of an insurance claim for business interruption from the roof collapse in January 1996.</p>
